---A monetary amount in a specific currency.
---@class anthropic.beta_deployments.BetaMonetaryAmount
---@field currency anthropic.beta_deployments.BetaCurrency|string Uppercase ISO-4217 currency code. `USD` is the only currency currently supported; the accepted set is closed and grows only when a new currency is priced.
---@field amount string Amount in minor units of the currency, as an integer decimal string with no leading zeros: "2500" is $25.00 and "50" is fifty cents. A string rather than a number so no float rounding is ever applied.

---@class anthropic.beta_deployments.CreateDeploymentRequest
---@field anthropicVersion? string The version of the Claude API you want to use. Read more about versioning and our version history [here](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/versioning).
---@field anthropicBeta? anthropic.beta_deployments.CreateDeploymentRequestAnthropicBetaList This endpoint is in beta: requests must send `managed-agents-2026-04-01` in this header.
---@field anthropicWorkspaceId? string Optional header to select the Workspace for this request. The value is a Workspace ID (for example, `wrkspc_011CZkZaBF1tNoB5wlCeusgy`). Only needed for credentials that can act on more than one Workspace. A credential that belongs to a specific Workspace may omit it; if sent, it must match that Workspace.
---@field name string Human-readable name for the deployment.
---@field description? string|distilled.Null Description of what the deployment does.
---@field agent anthropic.beta_deployments.BetaManagedAgentsAgentUnionParams Agent to deploy. Accepts the `agent` ID string, which pins the latest version, or an `agent` object with both id and version specified. The agent must exist and not be archived.
---@field environment_id string ID of the `environment` defining the container configuration for sessions created from this deployment.
---@field vault_ids? anthropic.beta_deployments.CreateDeploymentRequestVaultIdsList Vault IDs for stored credentials the agent can use during sessions created from this deployment. Maximum 50.
---@field initial_events anthropic.beta_deployments.CreateDeploymentRequestInitialEventsList Events to send to each session immediately after creation. At least 1, maximum 50.
---@field resources? anthropic.beta_deployments.CreateDeploymentRequestResourcesList Resources (e.g. repositories, files) to mount into each session's container. Maximum 500.
---@field metadata? anthropic.beta_deployments.CreateDeploymentRequestMetadataMap Arbitrary key-value metadata. Maximum 16 pairs, keys up to 64 chars, values up to 512 chars.
---@field schedule? anthropic.beta_deployments.BetaManagedAgentsCronScheduleParams|distilled.Null Optional recurring cron schedule. When present, the deployment fires automatically. Both expression and timezone are required when schedule is set.
---@field budget? anthropic.beta_deployments.BetaManagedAgentsBudgetLimit|distilled.Null Enforced spend ceiling stamped onto each session created from this deployment, copied at session-creation time. Omit to leave sessions uncapped. The deployment agent's model must have a public list price, or the request is rejected; a multiagent roster is re-validated in full when each fire copies the cap, which fails closed the same way.

---This endpoint is in beta: requests must send `managed-agents-2026-04-01` in this header.
